# Cloudflare _redirects only supports subpath (relative) redirects — you cannot
# match or redirect a different hostname here.
#
# The previous Netlify rule (a full cross-domain redirect, including the "!"
# force flag) is therefore not valid on Cloudflare. Handle anotherchris.net and
# the www subdomain at the zone level instead:
#
#   Cloudflare dashboard -> Rules -> Redirect Rules (or Bulk Redirects)
#     anotherchris.net/*  ->  https://yetanotherchris.dev/$1   301
#     www.yetanotherchris.dev/*  ->  https://yetanotherchris.dev/$1   301
#
